```mdl
verdict PlanRoute: Routes each road segment with both endpoints and writes routes and endpoint geo back.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-trip/src/types/RoutingOperation.ts#PlanRoute, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-trip/src/operations/plan-route.ts]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-trip/src/operations/plan-route.test.ts]
  walkthrough:
    - The operation declares the trip and optional provider input and the legs and totals output. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-trip/src/types/RoutingOperation.ts#PlanRoute
    - The handler picks a service, routes each complete road segment, and writes routes and geo with Obj.update. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-trip/src/operations/plan-route.ts
  note: |
    Behaviour matches and is tested. Two differences from the spec: no `NoRoutingService` error exists (a
    missing service fails with `RouteError('No routing service configured.')`), and an input that is not a
    Trip returns zeros instead of failing.
```

