```mdl
verdict OsrmRoutingService: Geocodes name-only waypoints with throttling, routes through OSRM, and maps legs into Routes.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-osrm/src/services/OsrmRoutingService.ts#makeOsrmRoutingService, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-osrm/src/services/NominatimClient.ts#geocode, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-osrm/src/services/OsrmClient.ts#fetchRoute, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-osrm/src/services/osrm-mapping.ts#parseRoutes, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-osrm/src/capabilities/routing-service.ts]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-osrm/src/services/OsrmRoutingService.test.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-osrm/src/services/osrm-mapping.test.ts]
  walkthrough:
    - The capability module contributes the service under TripCapabilities.RoutingService. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-osrm/src/capabilities/routing-service.ts
    - The service passes through Places, geocodes strings 1.1 s apart, and throws GeocodeError on no result. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-osrm/src/services/OsrmRoutingService.ts#makeOsrmRoutingService
    - The Nominatim client queries search with jsonv2, limit 1 and a User-Agent header. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-osrm/src/services/NominatimClient.ts#geocode
    - The OSRM client requests the driving route with full GeoJSON geometry and steps. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-osrm/src/services/OsrmClient.ts#fetchRoute
    - The mapper turns each OSRM route into a Route and throws RouteError when code is not Ok. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-osrm/src/services/osrm-mapping.ts#parseRoutes
  note: The User-Agent header is ignored by browsers, as the client's comment says.
```

